stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: propose_*
    Pending --> Approved: user accepts (elicitation)
    Pending --> Rejected: user declines / cancels
    Pending --> Expired: TTL elapsed
    Approved --> Applied: write succeeded
    Approved --> Failed: write failed (e.g. revision conflict)
    Rejected --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
    Applied --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
